# Spec 0050 — The library leaves the code; experiment kits; multi-setup inverse studies; the Measurement Planner

The requirement is `specs/0050/.manual/001-library-files-database-multi-setup-inverse.md` (called **001** below).
This document is the steering narrative every section's steps are read against. It enumerates no steps.

---

## 0. Wiring contract

What the change touches, in code, without the UI. The steps are the supporting evidence.

### 0.1 Existing artifacts and the modification each receives

| Artifact | Modification |
|---|---|
| `Berreman/Berreman/Dispersion.fs` — `EpsAxisDispersion`, `EpsWithDispValue` | `EpsAxisDispersion` gains data cases for tabulated n,k and for the four transcendental oscillator models. `EpsAxisEvaluated` and the custom equality are deleted. |
| `OpticalConstructor.Domain/DispersionModels.fs` — `DispersionModel.toEpsAxis` | The transcendental models lower to the new data case. Their evaluation kernels move into the core. |
