| Table samples | `Propagation.sampleMuellerSpun` | — |
| Fit quality | `FitQuality.residualJacobian`, `ResidualJacobian` (`columnNorms`, `conditionNumber`, `correlation`), `FitReport.standardErrors` | — |
| Noise / fit harness | `BerremanTests/InverseFitHarness.fs` → Optimization | Its product half |
| Ground truth | `BiaxialSample.fs`, `AbsorbingBiaxialSample.fs` → `BerremanTestSupport` | Their BerremanTests copies |
| §7.2 pipeline | `MuellerReconstructionTests` §7.2 → product staged path | The hand-composed body |
| Pre-fit checks | `SolverHandoffView` three checks, `ExperimentDataLoad.loadAndValidate` | `SolverHandoffView` / `Window` |
